.TH remove 1  "remove " 
.SH NAME
remove \- Remove a snippet (owner/name) from a collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBremove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICOLLECTION\fR> <\fISNIPPET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a snippet (owner/name) from a collection
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICOLLECTION\fR>
Collection name (yours)
.TP
<\fISNIPPET\fR>
Snippet reference: owner/name
